  "id": "voluntary-response",
  "term": "voluntary response",
  "definition": "A voluntary response is an intentional action, such as a keypress, made to produce a chosen effect or goal. In this research context, such responses can take on the positive or negative meaning of their intended effects through repeated pairing.",
